<title>SINGAPORE: US$300 mln cable award this month-SingTel.</title>
<headline>US$300 mln cable award this month-SingTel.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Telecommunications Ltd (SingTel) said on Friday the consortium building the world's longest submarine cable network would award contracts worth over US$300 million for the network's third and final leg this month.</p>
</text>
